Bootstrapping for ATS3 can be demonstrated as follows:
##################################################################
Makefile_xcmemit:
This Makefile uses a boostrapped [xats2cm_cmemit00_dats.cm]
(stored in ./../UTIL) to generate [lib/libxatsopt2js2cm] from
the source and then uses it to generate another version of the
compiler [xats2cm_cmemit00_dats.cm].
##################################################################
Makefile_testall:
This Makefile uses the generated [xats2cm_cmemit00_dats.cm]
(stored here) to generate [OUTS/libxatsopt2js2cm] from the source
which should be identical to [lib/libxatsopt2js2cm], demonstrating
a successful boostrapping for ATS3 (via Scheme).
##################################################################
